      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "holy"
      ],
      "text": "A creature can wear a willing cassisian as a helmet. While it does, the cassisian can't act, but the cassisian extends their +1 status bonus to AC and saves against unholy creatures to their wearer. At any time, the cassisian can detach themself from their wearer as a single action.\n\nEffect: Transfer Protection"
